      "source": "https://wikishire.co.uk/wiki/Rusholme"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "From 1947 to 1954, a converted Wesleyan church on Dickenson Road housed Mancunian Film Studios, filming many early Manchester movies on local streets.",
